  (20m) — Add mg.w2sa.online\; paste SPF\, DKIM\, MX\, CNAME at your DNS 
 host\; DMARC p=none.\nSean (T0): Stripe webhook check (10m) — Live endpo
 int deliveries all 2xx? If not\, stop and fix first — it's revenue.\nSea
 n (T0): LinkedIn admin access (10m) — Admin on the LV + W2SA company pag
 es\; create any that are missing.\nClaude: Draft P1 post + snippets — An
 nouncement/breakdown + 6–8 snippet lines\, by hand from the P1 paper.\nC
 laude: W2SA phone hotfix PR — Skip intro on phones\, Data Saver\, reduce
 d motion\; skip button ≥44 px.\nClaude: UTM sheet + analytics — One ta
 gged link per post\; both sites record UTM visits.\nClaude: P1 page → W2
 SA CTA — Visible\, UTM-tagged link to the free Digital Health Check.\nCo
 dex: Confirm P2 ran + QA — Find the 09:00 ET run\, run quality checks\, 
 flag for Sean.\nCodex: Commit & push all WIP — WP Factory\, LV\, Full Bu
 ild Factory P1–P4 — nothing local-only.\nCodex: Start generator fix 
 — Apply the fix defined in the WP Factory sitrep.\nCodex: P3: source 2 f
 acts — Primary sources only\; link + quote each for Sean.\nDone when: De
 cisions in · DNS added · webhook confirmed · no local-only work
